  "title": "FAQs for Sport Field Applications",
  "summary": "If you’re looking to build your own “Field of Dreams” or simply dry a puddle so the game can go on, Diamond Pro’s General Manager Rene Asprion has the answers. Since 1989, Texas-based Diamond Pro has used expanded shale and clay to pioneer infield conditioning, creating smooth, safe, and consistent ball fields that have become the industry standard. Rene Asprion shares his expertise, addressing common questions about sports field applications. The post FAQs for Sport Field Applications appeared first on Arcosa Lightweight 2026 .",
